    {
      "id": "p0093-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toriel asks the player to stay in the current room until she returns from an errand. If the player stays in the room for ten minutes, Toriel will call and say:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0877826,
          0.2307143,
          0.7063441,
          0.2678571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0877826,
          0.2307143,
          0.7063441,
          0.2678571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toriel 请玩家待在当前房间，等她办事回来。如果玩家在房间里等上十分钟，Toriel 就会打来电话说：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448299648203,
          0.2257142857142857,
          0.704302614334,
          0.2671428571428571
        ],
        "font_size": 19,
        "line_height": 1.4210526315789473,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448299648203,
          0.2257142857142857,
          0.704302614334,
          0.2671428571428571
        ],
        "font_size": 19,
        "leading": 27.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0093-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "It will take a little longer. Please understand.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1306532,
          0.2771429,
          0.7043026,
          0.2957143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1306532,
          0.2771429,
          0.7043026,
          0.2957143
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "It will take a little longer. Please understand.\n还需要再等一会儿。请理解。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.1347361523073739,
