    {
      "id": "p0093-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that “please understand” is a reference to Satoru Iwata, the former president of Nintendo. In his many English-language videos for Nintendo fans, Iwata often said “please understand”, a literal translation of a common Japanese apology. He repeated this peculiar English phrase so often that it became his unofficial catchphrase in the West.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0867619,
          0.305,
          0.7063441,
          0.3964286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0867619,
          0.305,
          0.7063441,
          0.3964286
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 解释说，“please understand”是在致敬任天堂前社长 Satoru Iwata（岩田聪）。在许多面向任天堂粉丝的英语视频中，岩田常说这句话；它直译自一种常见的日语致歉用语。他频繁使用这句特别的英语，使它在西方成了他非官方的标志性口头禅。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448299648203,
          0.3171428571428571,
          0.704302614334,
          0.4042857142857143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448299648203,
          0.3171428571428571,
          0.704302614334,
          0.4042857142857143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0093-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This reference would’ve been lost in a literal translation into Japanese, as Iwata was never famous for saying “please understand” in Japan. Undertale’s localizers considered potential replacement references, but eventually agreed that a natural-sounding translation took priority. Thus Toriel now says “I’m sorry” in Japanese instead of “please understand”.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0867619,
          0.4057143,
          0.3858353,
          0.59
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0867619,
          0.4057143,
          0.3858353,
          0.59
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如果直译成日文，这个梗就会消失，因为岩田在日本并不是以说“please understand”而闻名。Undertale 的本地化人员考虑过替换成其他典故，但最终一致认为，译文自然更重要。于是，日版 Toriel 说的是“对不起”，而不是“请理解”。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 60,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448,
          0.405,
          0.3858353,
          0.5964286
        ],
        "font_size": 18,
        "line_height": 1.5,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0908448,
          0.405,
          0.3858353,
          0.5964286
        ],
        "font_size": 18,
        "leading": 27.0
      },
      "annotations": []
