    {
      "id": "p0093-b012",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "“Please Understand” = It’s a meme in English speaking regions and apparently the typical 「ご理解ください」 [gorikai kudasai] has been translated into this. The Japanese phrase doesn’t have any specific meme-related meaning and Toriel saying 「ごりかいください」 [gorikai kudasai] would break the character, so I’ve prioritized making the translation natural.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1847518,
          0.8014286,
          0.6665357,
          0.8814286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1847518,
          0.8014286,
          0.6665357,
          0.8814286
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "“Please Understand”是英语地区的一个梗，似乎译自常见的「ご理解ください」（gorikai kudasai，请理解）。日语原句没有特定的梗含义；让 Toriel 说「ごりかいください」（gorikai kudasai，请理解）也不符合角色性格，所以我优先让译文自然。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
